// Brightness guard. With the app's adaptive brightness off, the panel should sit at the
// Screen light's level; Android's own auto-brightness or the quick-settings shade can pull
// it away. If the panel stays more than 8 points off for 15 s, re-apply the level through
// the app (at most once every 2 minutes, never during the screensaver).
